{% extends "base.html.jinja" %}
{%block title %}Rosario Now{% endblock %}
{% block head %}{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
  <main id="now">
    <header>
      <h1>What I'm doing</h1>
      <p>as of <time datetime="2025-07-13 01:34">2025-07-13 01:34</time></p>
    </header>
    <section>
      <h2>Studying</h2>
      <p> I'm taking classes in client-side web development and cryptography.
        I'm coming off of a flu and scrambling to catch up and prepare for midterms this week.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Moving</h2>
      <p>I will be staying with friends in between apartments next month,
        but I need to pack up the last of my belongings first.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Crocheting</h2>
      <p>My next project will be a giant orange pill bottle that doubles as a bag or basket (haven't decided which).
